  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.26 Participating hall",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.26 “Participating hall” means “participating hall” as defined in RSA 287-E:1, X, namely “a commercial hall or charitable organization approved by the commission that receives a simulcast of the shared carry-over coverall played at the host hall.”\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.23)",
